ReleaseGateMode.description:
Per-agent release-gate mode (ENG-727). ``off`` = no release checks;
``advisory`` = compute + display a verdict but never block activation.
The gate always runs and surfaces a verdict; it never refuses activation.

TurnAcceptedResponse.description:
Phase 3 split contract: POST enqueues a turn and returns its id + status;
the client then opens a separate ``…/turns/{turn_id}/stream`` SSE request to
watch it. ``status`` is ``queued`` immediately after enqueue.
